<title>FRANCE: Broker trims Gen des Eaux rating to buy.</title>
<headline>Broker trims Gen des Eaux rating to buy.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Broker Morgan Stanley trimmed its rating on shares in Generale des Eaux to 'buy' from 'strong buy' after the stock reached the target of 625 francs set by the firm.</p>
<p>Shares in Generale des Eaux, which have risen nearly 30 percent since the start of September, were up 0.32 percent at 622 francs at 1405 GMT in a declining market.</p>
<p>Several analysts say the share now has limited upside potential. Paribas Capital Markets sees it rising up to 650 francs, up five percent.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
